 with premium finishes","556c155f8362",[155],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":156,"_102":157},[],"Contemporary open-plan living design","0a245955a5fb",[161],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":162,"_102":163},[],"Original façade retained and enhanced","331167121285",[167],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":168,"_102":169},[],"Complete internal renovation","7c0f50d4a8d3",[174],[],"h3",{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":175,"_102":176},[],"Key Features","5249650a320d",[180],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":181,"_102":182},[],"Through detailed planning and quality craftsmanship, we delivered a home that feels entirely new while respecting the history of the original residence.","273e073527d7",[186],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":187,"_102":188},[],"Siari Build carefully retained the original architectural elements that defined the home’s character while completely transforming the interior to suit modern family living. The renovation included a new open-plan layout, upgraded kitchen and bathrooms, premium finishes, new flooring and contemporary lighting throughout.","9de8450e03bf",[192],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":193,"_102":194},[],"Our Solution","4bce58369a89",[198],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":199,"_102":200},[],"As with many renovation projects, working within an existing structure required flexibility and problem-solving to ensure the finished result met modern building standards without compromising the home’s original charm.","b70aec7a6448",[204],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":205,"_102":206},[],"The objective was to modernise an ageing home without losing its original character. Maintaining the structural integrity of the existing building while redesigning the internal layout, upgrading services and incorporating modern finishes required careful planning and detailed coordination throughout the construction process.","e9e1c760f2de",[210],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":211,"_102":212},[],"The Challenge","bc25cff8009a",[216],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":217,"_102":218},[],"The project significantly increased the property’s value while delivering a home that feels both contemporary and functional.","91f069301ca9",[222],[],{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":223,"_102":224},[],"The Brunswick Renovation involved the complete transformation of a 1970s double-storey brick residence into a contemporary family home while preserving its original character and street presence. By retaining the existing façade and completely reimagining the interior, this renovation successfully blended timeless architecture with modern living.","c37faabe7537",[229],[],"h2",{"_83":98,"_85":99,"_100":230,"_102":231},[],"Overview","1104f69b-626e-44c0-ae20-a51a0599a97b",[241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260],{"_49":31,"_50":30,"_51":52,"_53":54,"_55":238,"_57":239,"_59":240},"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/a5361fa28e76272cff59985b20fb73b9ae8e8353-1082x726.jpg","fraser-rise-residence","Fraser Rise Residence","Fraser Rise, VIC","300 sqm","2025",{"_83":373,"_85":86,"_87":374,"_93":375,"_95":228},{"_83":367,"_85":86,"_87":368,"_93":369,"_95":96},{"_83":361,"_85":86,"_87":362,"_93":363,"_95":96},{"_83":356,"_85":86,"_87":357,"_93":358,"_95":173},{"_83":350,"_85":86,"_87":351,"_93":352,"_95":96},{"_83":345,"_85":86,"_87":346,"_93":347,"_95":173},{"_83":339,"_85":86,"_87":340,"_93":341,"_95":96},{"_83":334,"_85":86,"_87":335,"_93":336,"_95":173},{"_83":328,"_85":86,"_87":329,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":330,"_95":96},{"_83":322,"_85":86,"_87":323,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":324,"_95":96},{"_83":316,"_85":86,"_87":317,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":318,"_95":96},{"_83":310,"_85":86,"_87":311,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":312,"_95":96},{"_83":304,"_85":86,"_87":305,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":306,"_95":96},{"_83":298,"_85":86,"_87":299,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":300,"_95":96},{"_83":292,"_85":86,"_87":293,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":294,"_95":96},{"_83":286,"_85":86,"_87":287,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":288,"_95":96},{"_83":280,"_85":86,"_87":281,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":282,"_95":96},{"_83":274,"_85":86,"_87":275,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":276,"_95":96},{"_83":268,"_85":86,"_87":269,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":270,"_95":96},{"_83":261,"_85":86,"_87":262,"_89":90,"_91":92,"_93":263,"_95":96},"4b62cba54ee3",[264],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":266,"_102":267},"0565a279f1e5",[],"Energy-efficient construction","6e8a639e08a0",[271],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":272,"_102":273},[],"Landscaped outdoor entertaining area","d364a05347c7",[277],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":278,"_102":279},[],"Double garage","0259bf041217",[283],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":284,"_102":285},[],"Engineered timber flooring","b5791400fc8c",[289],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":290,"_102":291},[],"Luxury bathrooms with premium fixtures","1e24d983000c",[295],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":296,"_102":297},[],"High ceilings throughout","de20ef939cf9",[301],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":302,"_102":303},[],"Premium custom joinery","71b68b397045",[307],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":308,"_102":309},[],"Designer kitchen with stone benchtops","b2ed5d9e6a14",[313],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":314,"_102":315},[],"Open-plan kitchen, living and dining","0b90a2c8d0fd",[319],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":320,"_102":321},[],"Double-storey family home","acf710faa369",[325],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":326,"_102":327},[],"Contemporary architectural façade","d32ac9d41855",[331],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":332,"_102":333},[],"Approximately 300sqm custom residence","11aefad74ad6",[337],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":338,"_102":176},[],"77a2c53a98bf",[342],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":343,"_102":344},[],"Siari Build managed every stage of the project, from planning and permits through to construction and final handover. By maintaining strict quality control and open communication throughout the build, we delivered a beautifully finished custom home that exceeded the client’s expectations while maintaining a smooth and efficient construction process.","0ed0ca0b575e",[348],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":349,"_102":194},[],"d0342d62e652",[353],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":354,"_102":355},[],"The goal was to create a modern family home that balanced contemporary design with everyday practicality while remaining within the client’s budget. Achieving premium finishes, functional living spaces and efficient construction required careful planning, strong project management and close coordination with consultants and trades throughout every stage of the build.","ac4e69b9998b",[359],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":360,"_102":212},[],"040a85be5f6a",[364],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":365,"_102":366},[],"Constructed through Siari Build’s complete design-to-handover service, the project reflects our commitment to quality craftsmanship, attention to detail and delivering exceptional outcomes for our clients.","5a7e4e09f699",[370],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":371,"_102":372},[],"The Fraser Rise Residence is a contemporary double-storey custom home designed to combine modern architecture with practical family living. At approximately 300sqm, this residence showcases clean architectural lines, quality finishes and thoughtfully designed living spaces, delivering a home that is both functional and timeless.","afdadf349b69",[376],[],{"_83":265,"_85":99,"_100":377,"_102":231},[],"4b879d29-b186-4f79-b95a-c8860c446343",[389,390,391,392,393,394,395,396,397,398,399,400,401,402,403,404,405,406,407,408,409,410,411],{"_49":28,"_50":27,"_51":384,"_53":385,"_55":386,"_57":387,"_59":388},"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/7fe91ada6fa35bdbebb3d6a4d90f668ddab70a59-2312x1544.jpg","bentleigh-east-development","Bentleigh East Development","Private Development","12 months","Bentleigh East, VIC","615 sqm","2023",{"_83":539,"_85":86,"_87":540,"_93":541,"_95":228},{"_83":533,"_85":86,"_87":534,"_93":535,"_95":96},{"_83":527,"_85":86,"_87":528,"_93":529,"_95":96},{"_83":522,"_85":86,"_87":523,"_93":524,"_95":173},{"_83":516,"_85":86,"_87":517,"_93":518,"_95":96},{"_83":510,"_85":86,"_87":5